#. type: Plain text
#: en/minios-image-builder.1:6
msgid "minios-image-builder - customize MiniOS as a verified image"
msgstr "minios-image-builder - kustomisasi MiniOS sebagai citra terverifikasi"

#. type: SH
#: en/minios-image-builder.1:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "USAGE"
msgstr "PENGGUNAAN"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/minios-image-builder.1:8
msgid "\\f[B]minios-image-builder\\fR"
msgstr "\\f[B]minios-image-builder\\fR"

#. type: SH
#: en/minios-image-builder.1:8 en/minios-image-compose.1:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "DESKRIPSI"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/minios-image-builder.1:15
msgid ""
"\\f[B]minios-image-builder\\f[R] launches MiniOS Image Builder, a GTK "
"project workspace for remastering MiniOS through \\f[B]minios-image-"
"compose\\f[R](1).  It selects and fingerprints a MiniOS source, lets the "
"user select source and additional \\f[B].sb\\f[R] modules, creates a secure "
"build plan, and structurally verifies the private ISO before publishing it."
"\\fR"
msgstr ""
"\\f[B]minios-image-builder\\f[R] meluncurkan MiniOS Image Builder, sebuah "
"ruang kerja proyek GTK untuk meremaster MiniOS melalui \\f[B]minios-image-"
"compose\\f[R](1). Ini memilih dan membuat sidik jari sumber MiniOS, "
"memungkinkan pengguna memilih sumber dan modul tambahan \\f[B].sb\\f[R], "
"membuat rencana build yang aman, dan memverifikasi struktur ISO privat "
"sebelum dipublikasikan.\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/minios-image-builder.1:26
msgid ""
"The application runs inside MiniOS and never source-builds MiniOS or "
"modifies source media.  The source can be the current session, a MiniOS ISO "
"file, or an optical disc.  ISO and optical-disc sources are mounted read-"
"only through \\f[B]udisksctl\\f[R].  The application and composition remain "
"unprivileged.  A fixed path-bound helper reads \\f[B]/etc/live/"
"config.conf\\f[R] only when it is root-only; optional writable-session "
"capture authorizes only trusted \\f[B]savechanges\\f[R](1).\\fR"
msgstr ""
"Aplikasi berjalan di dalam MiniOS dan tidak pernah membangun MiniOS dari "
"sumber atau memodifikasi media sumber. Sumber dapat berupa sesi saat ini, "
"berkas ISO MiniOS, atau cakram optik. Sumber ISO dan cakram optik dipasang "
"hanya-baca melalui \\f[B]udisksctl\\f[R]. Aplikasi dan komposisi tetap tanpa "
"hak istimewa. Sebuah helper tetap yang terikat pada jalur hanya membaca "
"\\f[B]/etc/live/config.conf\\f[R] ketika hanya root yang dapat mengaksesnya; "
"penangkapan sesi-tulis opsional hanya mengizinkan \\f[B]savechanges\\f[R](1) "
"yang tepercaya.\\fR"

#. type: SH
#: en/minios-image-builder.1:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "WORKFLOW"
msgstr "ALUR KERJA"

#. type: TP
#: en/minios-image-builder.1:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "\\f[B]Source\\fR"
msgstr "\\f[B]Sumber\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/minios-image-builder.1:33
msgid ""
"Select the current livekit or dracut session, a MiniOS ISO file, or an "
"optical disc asynchronously.  The page shows backend, media category, source "
"path, release, version, architecture, bootloader, size, module counts, and "
"diagnostics."
msgstr ""
"Pilih sesi livekit atau dracut saat ini, file ISO MiniOS, atau cakram optik "
"secara asinkron.  Halaman ini menampilkan backend, kategori media, path "
"sumber, rilis, versi, arsitektur, bootloader, ukuran, jumlah modul, dan "
"diagnostik."

#. type: TP
#: en/minios-image-builder.1:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "\\f[B]Content\\fR"
msgstr "\\f[B]Konten\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/minios-image-builder.1:40
msgid ""
"Select source modules and add external \\f[B].sb\\f[R] files.  Required core "
"and kernel modules remain selected and locked.  Active modules outside the "
"source media are shown separately and are not included automatically.  "
"Basename and target collisions block continuation.\\fR"
msgstr ""
"Pilih modul sumber dan tambahkan file eksternal \\f[B].sb\\f[R].  Modul inti "
"dan kernel yang dibutuhkan tetap terpilih dan terkunci.  Modul aktif di luar "
"media sumber ditampilkan secara terpisah dan tidak disertakan secara "
"otomatis.  Tabrakan basename dan target akan memblokir kelanjutan.\\fR"

#. type: TP
#: en/minios-image-builder.1:40
#, no-wrap
msgid "\\f[B]Settings\\fR"
msgstr "\\f[B]Pengaturan\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/minios-image-builder.1:54
msgid ""
"Select output identity, allowlisted system defaults, boot behavior and PNG "
"appearance, an optional root-relative project filesystem layer, and optional "
"session capture.  Security, user-data, and expert kernel controls remain in "
"compact expanders.  Empty or Keep current values preserve source behavior.  "
"Inclusion of \\f[B]/etc/live/config.conf\\f[R] is currently required.  Its "
"bytes are read and copied verbatim, frozen during planning, and staged mode "
"0600 in the private build job.  Its values are not interpreted, displayed, "
"or logged.  A loaded \\f[CR]include_current_config=false\\f[R] value is "
"preserved but blocks Review.\\fR"
msgstr ""
"Pilih identitas keluaran, default sistem yang diizinkan, perilaku boot dan "
"tampilan PNG, lapisan filesystem proyek opsional yang relatif terhadap root, "
"dan penangkapan sesi opsional.  Kontrol keamanan, data pengguna, dan kernel "
"ahli tetap dalam ekspander ringkas.  Nilai kosong atau Pertahankan nilai "
"saat ini akan mempertahankan perilaku sumber.  Penyertaan \\f[B]/etc/live/"
"config.conf\\f[R] saat ini diwajibkan.  Byte-nya dibaca dan disalin persis, "
"dibekukan selama perencanaan, dan dipasang dengan mode 0600 di job build "
"privat.  Nilai-nilainya tidak diinterpretasikan, ditampilkan, atau dicatat.  "
"Nilai \\f[CR]include_current_config=false\\f[R] yang dimuat akan "
"dipertahankan tetapi memblokir Review.\\fR"

#. type: TP
#: en/minios-image-builder.1:54
#, no-wrap
msgid "\\f[B]Review\\fR"
msgstr "\\f[B]Tinjau\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/minios-image-builder.1:66
msgid ""
"Create a fresh build plan and show selected, deselected, and additional "
"modules, output defaults, path-free customization intent, capture mode and "
"privilege boundary, size estimates, warnings, and stable diagnostic codes.  "
"Configuration values, raw kernel arguments, private customization paths, and "
"selected capture paths are never shown.  An existing output is replaced only "
"after confirmation and a new backend plan bound to the same observed file "
"identity.  Cancellation, failure, or an identity mismatch clears approval, "
"so every retry asks again."
msgstr ""
"Buat rencana build baru dan tampilkan modul yang dipilih, tidak dipilih, dan "
"tambahan, default keluaran, niat kustomisasi tanpa path, mode penangkapan "
"dan batas priviledge, estimasi ukuran, peringatan, dan kode diagnostik "
"stabil.  Nilai konfigurasi, argumen kernel mentah, path kustomisasi privat, "
"dan path penangkapan yang dipilih tidak pernah ditampilkan.  Keluaran yang "
"sudah ada hanya akan diganti setelah konfirmasi dan rencana backend baru "
"terikat pada identitas file yang sama.  Pembatalan, kegagalan, atau "
"ketidakcocokan identitas akan menghapus persetujuan, sehingga setiap "
"percobaan ulang akan meminta persetujuan lagi."

#. type: TP
#: en/minios-image-builder.1:66
#, no-wrap
msgid "\\f[B]Build\\fR"
msgstr "\\f[B]Bangun\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/minios-image-builder.1:73
msgid ""
"Revalidate every effective input, execute \\f[B]minios-image-compose\\f[R] "
"with list-based argv in the backend\\[cq]s descriptor-bound working "
"directory, capture writable changes when requested, structurally verify "
"customization and capture attestations, and publish atomically only after "
"verification succeeds.\\fR"
msgstr ""
"Validasi ulang setiap masukan yang efektif, jalankan \\f[B]minios-image-"
"compose\\f[R] dengan argv berbasis daftar di direktori kerja yang terikat "
"deskriptor backend, tangkap perubahan yang dapat ditulis jika diminta, "
"verifikasi kustomisasi secara struktural dan tangkap atestasi, lalu "
"publikasikan secara atomik hanya setelah verifikasi berhasil.\\fR"

#. type: SH
#: en/minios-image-builder.1:73
#, no-wrap
msgid "IMAGE CUSTOMIZATION"
msgstr "KUSTOMISASI CITRA"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/minios-image-builder.1:80
msgid ""
"System controls cover hostname, timezone, default target, and enabled or "
"disabled services.  Security and access controls expose only backend-"
"allowlisted sudo, polkit, SSH, XRDP, X11, lock-screen, and issue-hint "
"modes.  User data can link or bind user directories, but not both, and "
"accepts a validated root-relative user-directory path."
msgstr ""
"Kontrol sistem mencakup hostname, zona waktu, target default, serta layanan "
"yang diaktifkan atau dinonaktifkan.  Kontrol keamanan dan akses hanya "
"menampilkan mode sudo, polkit, SSH, XRDP, X11, lock-screen, dan issue-hint "
"yang diizinkan backend.  Data pengguna dapat menautkan atau mengikat "
"direktori pengguna, tetapi tidak keduanya, dan menerima path direktori "
"pengguna yang divalidasi relatif terhadap root."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/minios-image-builder.1:85
msgid ""
"Boot controls preserve or set a 0-300 second timeout and default resume/new/"
"choose/fresh/toram session.  Expert kernel arguments are validated for "
"bootloader-safe syntax.  Boot backgrounds must be valid PNG files."
msgstr ""
"Kontrol boot mempertahankan atau mengatur timeout 0-300 detik dan sesi "
"default resume/new/choose/fresh/toram.  Argumen kernel tingkat ahli "
"divalidasi untuk sintaks yang aman bagi bootloader.  Latar belakang boot "
"harus berupa file PNG yang valid."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/minios-image-builder.1:93
msgid ""
"The project filesystem layer is an existing canonical real directory, or a "
"mode-0700 directory created by the backend beneath the project directory.  "
"The tree is copied relative to image root.  No scripts, raw shell, chroot, "
"or package commands are exposed, and the source directory is never deleted.  "
"Reusable modules belong in Module Manager."
msgstr ""
"Lapisan filesystem proyek adalah direktori nyata kanonik yang sudah ada, "
"atau direktori mode-0700 yang dibuat oleh backend di bawah direktori "
"proyek.  Pohon disalin relatif terhadap root citra.  Tidak ada skrip, shell "
"mentah, chroot, atau perintah paket yang diekspos, dan direktori sumber "
"tidak pernah dihapus.  Modul yang dapat digunakan ulang ditempatkan di "
"Module Manager."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/minios-image-builder.1:101
msgid ""
"Review presents only override key names, boot settings, kernel byte count "
"and SHA-256, background basename/digest, and overlay basename/fingerprint/"
"counts.  Successful verification presents the corresponding attested summary "
"and overlay module size/hash.  Composition is unprivileged; authorization is "
"limited to the fixed config reader and optional session capture."
msgstr ""
"Tinjauan hanya menampilkan nama kunci override, pengaturan boot, jumlah byte "
"kernel dan SHA-256, nama dasar/digest latar belakang, serta nama dasar/"
"fingerprint/jumlah overlay.  Verifikasi yang berhasil menampilkan ringkasan "
"yang diatestasi beserta ukuran/hash modul overlay terkait.  Komposisi tidak "
"memiliki hak istimewa; otorisasi dibatasi pada pembaca konfigurasi tetap dan "
"penangkapan sesi opsional."

#. type: SH
#: en/minios-image-builder.1:101
#, no-wrap
msgid "CANCELLATION"
msgstr "PEMBATALAN"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/minios-image-builder.1:114
msgid ""
"Inventory, build, and verification subprocesses run in dedicated process "
"groups.  Inventory cancellation requests an identity-bound private backend "
"marker before sending \\f[B]SIGTERM\\f[R], then escalates to "
"\\f[B]SIGKILL\\f[R] after a short grace period.  Build cancellation signals "
"\\f[B]minios-image-compose\\f[R], whose trap owns its internal capture "
"marker.  Pure Python hashing may finish its current pass before cancellation "
"reaches a safe checkpoint; stale results are discarded and close waits for "
"tracked work.  Atomic publication is not cancelled after it starts, so the "
"destination is never intentionally left half-written.\\fR"
msgstr ""
"Subproses inventarisasi, build, dan verifikasi berjalan dalam grup proses "
"khusus.  Permintaan pembatalan inventarisasi meminta penanda backend privat "
"yang terikat identitas sebelum mengirim \\f[B]SIGTERM\\f[R], lalu meningkat "
"ke \\f[B]SIGKILL\\f[R] setelah masa tenggang singkat.  Pembatalan build "
"memberi sinyal ke \\f[B]minios-image-compose\\f[R], yang trap-nya memiliki "
"penanda penangkapan internal.  Hashing Python murni dapat menyelesaikan pass "
"saat ini sebelum pembatalan mencapai checkpoint yang aman; hasil usang "
"dibuang dan close menunggu pekerjaan yang dilacak.  Publikasi atomik tidak "
"dibatalkan setelah dimulai, sehingga tujuan tidak pernah sengaja dibiarkan "
"setengah tertulis.\\fR"

#. type: SH
#: en/minios-image-builder.1:114
#, no-wrap
msgid "REQUIREMENTS"
msgstr "PERSYARATAN"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/minios-image-builder.1:127
msgid ""
"The composition backend is provided by the matching \\f[B]minios-image-"
"compose\\f[R] package, guaranteed by an exact package dependency.  Session "
"capture additionally uses \\f[B]savechanges\\f[R] from \\f[B]minios-"
"tools\\f[R] 1.5.0 or newer.  \\f[B]pkexec\\f[R] is required; a desktop "
"polkit agent is recommended for root-only current configurations and non-"
"root session capture.  \\f[B]udisksctl\\f[R] from \\f[B]udisks2\\f[R] is "
"required for ISO-file and optical-disc sources.  Capture is enabled only "
"after a successful savechanges version probe.  The launcher prefers "
"distribution-owned \\f[B]/usr/bin\\f[R] tools over local shadows.\\fR"
msgstr ""
"Backend komposisi disediakan oleh paket \\f[B]minios-image-compose\\f[R] "
"yang cocok, dijamin oleh dependensi paket yang tepat.  Penangkapan sesi juga "
"menggunakan \\f[B]savechanges\\f[R] dari \\f[B]minios-tools\\f[R] 1.5.0 atau "
"lebih baru.  \\f[B]pkexec\\f[R] diperlukan; agen polkit desktop "
"direkomendasikan untuk konfigurasi saat ini yang hanya root dan penangkapan "
"sesi non-root.  \\f[B]udisksctl\\f[R] dari \\f[B]udisks2\\f[R] diperlukan "
"untuk sumber file ISO dan cakram optik.  Penangkapan diaktifkan hanya "
"setelah pemeriksaan versi savechanges berhasil.  Launcher lebih memilih alat "
"\\f[B]/usr/bin\\f[R] milik distribusi daripada bayangan lokal.\\fR"

#. type: SH
#: en/minios-image-builder.1:127
#, no-wrap
msgid "PROJECTS"
msgstr "PROYEK"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/minios-image-builder.1:134
msgid ""
"Projects are JSON documents written through the ImageProject backend.  Use "
"the header actions or \\f[B]Ctrl+N\\f[R], \\f[B]Ctrl+O\\f[R], "
"\\f[B]Ctrl+S\\f[R], and \\f[B]Ctrl+Shift+S\\f[R] to create, open, save, or "
"save as.  Unsaved changes require confirmation before closing or replacing "
"the current project.\\fR"
msgstr ""
"Proyek adalah dokumen JSON yang ditulis melalui backend ImageProject.  "
"Gunakan aksi header atau \\f[B]Ctrl+N\\f[R], \\f[B]Ctrl+O\\f[R], "
"\\f[B]Ctrl+S\\f[R], dan \\f[B]Ctrl+Shift+S\\f[R] untuk membuat, membuka, "
"menyimpan, atau menyimpan sebagai.  Perubahan yang belum disimpan memerlukan "
"konfirmasi sebelum menutup atau mengganti proyek saat ini.\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/minios-image-builder.1:141
msgid ""
"Capture mode, normalized selected paths, compression, and sensitive-capture "
"acknowledgement are project intent.  Session inventories are runtime-only "
"and are never written to project files.  Exact acknowledgement is stored in "
"the project and remains in effect until revoked."
msgstr ""
"Mode capture, path terpilih yang dinormalisasi, kompresi, dan pengakuan "
"capture sensitif adalah maksud proyek.  Inventaris sesi hanya berlaku saat "
"runtime dan tidak pernah ditulis ke file proyek.  Pengakuan persis disimpan "
"di proyek dan tetap berlaku sampai dicabut."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/minios-image-builder.1:146
msgid ""
"Customization fields are also project intent.  Older projects without them "
"load Preserve source defaults.  Save As preserves absolute output, "
"background, overlay, and module targets while invalidating plans when "
"project base changes."
msgstr ""
"Kolom kustomisasi juga merupakan maksud proyek.  Proyek lama tanpa kolom "
"tersebut akan memuat default sumber Preserve.  Simpan Sebagai mempertahankan "
"output absolut, latar belakang, overlay, dan target modul sambil membatalkan "
"rencana ketika basis proyek berubah."

#. type: SH
#: en/minios-image-builder.1:146
#, no-wrap
msgid "CAPTURE MODES"
msgstr "MODE CAPTURE"

#. type: TP
#: en/minios-image-builder.1:147
#, no-wrap
msgid "\\f[B]Current composition\\fR"
msgstr "\\f[B]Komposisi saat ini\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/minios-image-builder.1:153
msgid ""
"Use selected source modules and current configuration without writable-"
"session capture.  Composition is unprivileged; a root-only current "
"configuration may require authorization for the fixed packaged reader."
msgstr ""
"Gunakan modul sumber yang dipilih dan konfigurasi saat ini tanpa capture "
"sesi-tulis.  Komposisi tidak memiliki hak istimewa; konfigurasi saat ini "
"yang hanya root mungkin memerlukan otorisasi untuk pembaca paket tetap."

#. type: TP
#: en/minios-image-builder.1:153
#, no-wrap
msgid "\\f[B]Exact session\\fR"
msgstr "\\f[B]Sesi persis\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/minios-image-builder.1:159
msgid ""
"Preserve writable changes supported by the detected OverlayFS or AUFS "
"provider.  This union-specific mode may preserve secrets, identities, "
"personal files, and logs, and requires explicit acknowledgement."
msgstr ""
"Pertahankan perubahan yang dapat ditulis yang didukung oleh penyedia "
"OverlayFS atau AUFS yang terdeteksi.  Mode khusus union ini dapat "
"mempertahankan rahasia, identitas, file pribadi, dan log, serta memerlukan "
"pengakuan eksplisit."

#. type: TP
#: en/minios-image-builder.1:159
#, no-wrap
msgid "\\f[B]Privacy-cleaned\\fR"
msgstr "\\f[B]Bersih privasi\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/minios-image-builder.1:165
msgid ""
"Use the strict software and safe-default allowlist.  Broad system, identity, "
"cache, log, and user state is intentionally omitted.  This is not a "
"guarantee that the result is shareable."
msgstr ""
"Gunakan allowlist perangkat lunak ketat dan default-aman.  Sistem, "
"identitas, cache, log, dan status pengguna yang luas sengaja dihilangkan.  "
"Ini bukan jaminan bahwa hasilnya dapat dibagikan."

#. type: TP
#: en/minios-image-builder.1:165
#, no-wrap
msgid "\\f[B]Selected changes\\fR"
msgstr "\\f[B]Perubahan terpilih\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/minios-image-builder.1:173
msgid ""
"Capture at least one normalized path selected from an analyzed inventory.  "
"Selecting a directory represents descendants; \\f[B]savechanges\\f[R] "
"enforces actual matching.  Advanced include/exclude editors expose all "
"loaded rules.  Exact and ancestor exclusions override matching row selection."
"\\fR"
msgstr ""
"Tangkap setidaknya satu path yang dinormalisasi yang dipilih dari inventaris "
"yang dianalisis.  Memilih direktori mewakili turunannya; "
"\\f[B]savechanges\\f[R] menegakkan pencocokan yang sebenarnya.  Editor "
"include/exclude lanjutan menampilkan semua aturan yang dimuat.  Pengecualian "
"tepat dan leluhur mengesampingkan pemilihan baris yang cocok.\\fR"

#. type: SH
#: en/minios-image-builder.1:173
#, no-wrap
msgid "SESSION INVENTORY"
msgstr "INVENTARIS SESI"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/minios-image-builder.1:180
msgid ""
"Analyze session changes is an explicit action.  It creates a private "
"mode-0700 workspace, obtains narrow savechanges \\[en]inventory-json argv "
"from the backend, uses pkexec only when authorization is needed, validates "
"the mode-0600 result, and removes the workspace by device and inode "
"identity.  Command output and private paths are not logged."
msgstr ""
"Menganalisis perubahan sesi adalah tindakan eksplisit.  Ini membuat "
"workspace mode-0700 privat, memperoleh argv savechanges \\[en]inventory-json "
"yang sempit dari backend, menggunakan pkexec hanya saat otorisasi "
"diperlukan, memvalidasi hasil mode-0600, dan menghapus workspace berdasarkan "
"identitas perangkat dan inode.  Output perintah dan path privat tidak "
"dicatat."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/minios-image-builder.1:196
msgid ""
"The inventory contains metadata, not file content, but filenames are "
"sensitive.  It remains in memory only.  The interface shows aggregate union, "
"entry, byte, category, sensitive, exact-default, and privacy-cleaned-default "
"counts.  Selected paths appear only in the in-memory selector; Review shows "
"count and digest.  The selector materializes 500 rows at a time with a 2,000-"
"row hard display cap and reports displayed, matching, and total counts.  "
"Search is debounced and filters the complete inventory.  Reanalysis, Source "
"refresh, cancellation/failure, and new/open project transitions clear "
"inventory, search, filters, and displayed rows while preserving loaded "
"selection rules.  Successful Selected-changes attestation repeats the Review "
"selection count and verified digest."
msgstr ""
"Inventaris berisi metadata, bukan konten file, tetapi nama file bersifat "
"sensitif.  Ini hanya tetap di memori.  Antarmuka menampilkan jumlah agregat "
"union, entri, byte, kategori, sensitif, exact-default, dan privacy-cleaned-"
"default.  Path yang dipilih hanya muncul di selector dalam memori; Review "
"menampilkan jumlah dan digest.  Selector mematerialisasi 500 baris sekaligus "
"dengan batas tampilan keras 2.000 baris dan melaporkan jumlah yang "
"ditampilkan, cocok, dan total.  Pencarian didelay dan memfilter seluruh "
"inventaris.  Reanalisis, refresh Sumber, pembatalan/kegagalan, dan transisi "
"proyek baru/buka menghapus inventaris, pencarian, filter, dan baris yang "
"ditampilkan sambil mempertahankan aturan seleksi yang dimuat.  Attestasi "
"Selected-changes yang berhasil mengulangi jumlah seleksi Review dan digest "
"yang terverifikasi."

#. type: SH
#: en/minios-image-builder.1:196
#, no-wrap
msgid "BOOT TESTING"
msgstr "PENGUJIAN BOOT"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/minios-image-builder.1:201
msgid ""
"After a successful build, the application can report that external boot "
"testing is available when an installed VirtualBox or QEMU executable is "
"detected.  It does not install, recommend, configure, or invoke a hypervisor."
msgstr ""
"Setelah build berhasil, aplikasi dapat melaporkan bahwa pengujian boot "
"eksternal tersedia ketika executable VirtualBox atau QEMU yang terpasang "
"terdeteksi.  Ini tidak menginstal, merekomendasikan, mengonfigurasi, atau "
"menjalankan hypervisor."

